Package: FLStockpile
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Access the ICES Stockpile of Stock Assessment Results
Authors@R: c(person("Colin", "Millar", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "colin.millar@ices.dk"),
             person("Neil", "Campbell", role = "aut"))
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports: arrow,
         stats,
         utils
Suggests: FLCore
Additional_repositories: https://flr.r-universe.dev
Description: Read the stock assessment results submitted to ICES, the observed
             data and the model estimates for each stock, from a set of parquet
             files. The results can be used as plain data frames, or converted
             to 'FLStock' objects if the 'FLCore' package is installed.
